{
  "project_id": 22,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 10005,
  "title": "Keep your goals to yourself",
  "author": "Derek Sivers",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/derek_sivers_keep_your_goals_to_yourself",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T07:47:53.825921Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T07:47:53.825921Z",
  "lead_time": 23.328,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "Everyone, please think of your biggest personal goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A8C29426A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "For real -- you can take a second.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "59910AA507",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "You've got to feel this to learn it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3656344F63",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "Take a few seconds and think of your personal biggest goal, okay?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "747F983709",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "Imagine deciding right now that you're going to do it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B1D676DB6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "Imagine telling someone that you meet today what you're going to do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E271F68B98",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "Imagine their congratulations, and their high image of you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "27852A9D4D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Doesn't it feel good to say it out loud?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AB3ECFA737",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "Don't you feel one step closer already, like it's already becoming part of your identity?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BBB91FF1D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "Well, bad news: you should have kept your mouth shut, because that good feeling now will make you less likely to do it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A80EB4CDEF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "The repeated psychology tests have proven that telling someone your goal makes it less likely to happen.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "25E138649B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 124,
        "text": "Any time you have a goal, there are some steps that need to be done, some work that needs to be done in order to achieve it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9404FAAC47",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "Ideally you would not be satisfied until you'd actually done the work.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F793CCFB7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "But when you tell someone your goal and they acknowledge it, psychologists have found that it's called a \"social reality.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0081A8B3AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "The mind is kind of tricked into feeling that it's already done.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7E73CD1E78",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 76,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "the actual hard work",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "76F319E80B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "you've felt",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "27CB821174",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "So this goes against conventional wisdom that we should tell our friends our goals, right?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "64BA9121FB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "So they hold us to it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "919455DC3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "So, let's look at the proof. 1926: Kurt Lewin, founder of social psychology, called this \"substitution.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "107BB8ACA9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 195,
        "text": "1933: Wera Mahler found when it was acknowledged by others, it felt real in the mind. 1982, Peter Gollwitzer wrote a whole book about this, and in 2009, he did some new tests that were published.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE550B94A5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "It goes like this: 163 people across four separate tests.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "41B1B3F01F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Everyone wrote down their personal goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "20E2F78B58",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "Then half of them announced their commitment to this goal to the room, and half didn't.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3CC7F79FDB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 145,
        "text": "Then everyone was given 45 minutes of work that would directly lead them towards their goal, but they were told that they could stop at any time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "074D0D24AA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 184,
        "text": "Now, those who kept their mouths shut worked the entire 45 minutes on average, and when asked afterward, said that they felt that they had a long way to go still to achieve their goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D9D68A0F36",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 153,
        "text": "But those who had announced it quit after only 33 minutes, on average, and when asked afterward, said that they felt much closer to achieving their goal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B36792BC36",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "So if this is true, what can we do?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F159A0E79B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 6,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "you could resist",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CA6E867C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 144,
        "text": "You can delay the gratification that the social acknowledgment brings, and you can understand that your mind mistakes the talking for the doing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9C0C07509",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 189,
        "endOffset": 200,
        "text": "kick my ass",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5BE760411E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "you can state it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6AC250398F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 11,
        "text": "So audience",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FFD69CFBC5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "next time you're tempted to tell someone your goal, what will you say?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2B9528133E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 10,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "Exactly!",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6D63116A43",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Well done.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6FCD1C061E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "(Laughter) (Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6C46611C12",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}